    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Methodology &amp; Data Sources'>
      <style />
      <size maxheight='860' maxwidth='1250' minheight='850' minwidth='1250' sizing-mode='range' />
      <zones>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='10814' id='3' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='480' y='1395'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14'>U.S Housing Market Investment &amp; Affordability Analysis</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10' italic='true'>Methodology, Data Sources &amp; Assumptions</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='17209' id='4' type-v2='text' w='95600' x='2240' y='12907'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Data Sources</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Zillow Research</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'> — Zillow Home Value Index (ZHVI), Zillow Observed Rent Index (ZORI), and For-Sale Inventory data at the U.S. metropolitan-area level.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Federal Reserve Economic Data (FRED)</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'> — 30-Year Fixed Rate Mortgage Average in the United States (MORTGAGE30US). Weekly observations were converted to monthly averages for historical analysis.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>U.S. Census Bureau — American Community Survey (ACS)</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'> — 2024 ACS 5-Year Estimate, B19013 Median Household Income, used for metropolitan-area affordability analysis.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='26744' id='5' type-v2='text' w='94880' x='1680' y='29884'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Analysis Methodology</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Market Trends</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'> — Home values, rents, and housing inventory were analyzed at the metropolitan-area level. Year-over-year growth rates compare December 2024 with December 2023.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Affordability</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'> — December 2024 home values and rents were compared with 2024 ACS 5-Year median household income. Price-to-Income Ratio was calculated as typical home value divided by median household income.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Mortgage Costs</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'> — Estimated monthly principal and interest payments assume a 20% down payment, a 30-year fixed-rate mortgage, and the 2024 average mortgage rate of </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>6.724%</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Investment Growth Score</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'> — A custom market-comparison metric calculated using equal weighting: </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>50% Home Value Growth + 50% Rent Growth</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='26860' id='6' type-v2='text' w='96160' x='1600' y='54070'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Assumptions &amp; Limitations</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Mortgage Estimate</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'> — Mortgage payments represent principal and interest only. Estimates exclude property taxes, homeowners insurance, HOA fees, maintenance costs, closing costs, and other ownership expenses. PMI is not assumed because the calculation uses a 20% down payment.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Income Benchmark</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'> — 2024 ACS 5-Year median household income is used as a cross-sectional affordability benchmark and is not applied to historical housing data outside the 2024 analysis.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Metro Matching</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'> — Census metropolitan areas were cross-referenced to Zillow metro names to combine housing and income data. Metros without a reliable Census-to-Zillow match were excluded from affordability comparisons.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Investment Growth Score</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'> — This is a custom analytical metric created for this project and should not be interpreted as an established investment-return measure or investment recommendation.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone h='20581' id='9' type-v2='text' w='96480' x='1760' y='79302'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Data Preparation</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='8'>Housing datasets were transformed from wide monthly formats into analysis-ready tables using Excel Power Query. Date fields and numeric measures were standardized, mortgage-rate observations were aggregated from weekly to monthly averages, and Census metro income data was cleaned and mapped to corresponding Zillow metropolitan areas.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
